SY_TALK("J8RpwoteQhQ",[[7776,["It has been such a great treat for us,","not only entertainment,"]],[7788,["but the way for our future – how to move","and what to do."]],[7797,["It’s very surprising that this Swiss bank","business"]],[7806,["has been attracting My attention","all the time."]],[7813,["I don’t know much, how they can digest","everything so well."]],[7822,["In these modern times, when people are","talking of democracy,"]],[7830,["talking of very big ideal things and","all that,"]],[7833,["at the same time how can such a illegal","system exist openly?"]],[7844,["And for that I have a plan."]],[7848,["As Arneau has said I have to expose, I have","a plan to do something about it."]],[7855,["As far as the materialism is concerned,","it’s working out."]],[7861,["All these countries who were supposed to","be very advanced, developed are suffering;"]],[7868,["first from recession – and a terrible","recession."]],[7873,["That recession is going to give them","a lesson"]],[7877,["about overproduction of nonsensical goods."]],[7886,["Materialism comes because people have","gone mad with their greed."]],[7894,["I was searching a house in England – went","round to see houses, and I was surprised"]],[7903,["that all kinds of plastic things and mixed","things and all that,"]],[7909,["were piled up in mountains in every house,","mountains!"]],[7913,["And you pass through a door you will find","two legs of a pant falling on you."]],[7921,["But not only in England, same in Paris:"]],[7925,["I’ve seen people accumulating so much","of nonsense"]],[7930,["that they don’t know where to put it and","what to do."]],[7935,["This madness is on and on and on."]],[7940,["Now, I have found out a solution for Sahaja","Yogis, what they should do."]],[7946,["They should try to encourage handicrafts."]],[7952,["Every country I went to, I bought","handicrafts,"]],[7957,["whether it was Czechoslovakia or England","or anywhere."]],[7965,["I cannot understand – how can you go","and buy this rubbish of plastic,"]],[7971,["of these useless things?"]],[7974,["And these handicrafts, when I bought,","I was surprised –"]],[7978,["I must tell you about Czechoslovakia that","there were small, small, very small shops"]],[7985,["and they all came, one by one, “Mother,","buy something from us also,"]],[7989,["Mother buy something from us”. You know,","I was surprised, such beautiful things."]],[7994,["They said, “We cannot sell them.” But all","nonsensical things people are buying."]],[8002,["So for Sahaja Yogis, they must take a vow"]],[8005,["that “we’ll only take things which are","handmade”."]],[8009,["You need not have many things, you can","have few, but something handmade."]],[8017,["Now, supposing you get a dress, there","should be some handmade embroidery"]],[8024,["or something put it on that, so some labor","is put in into that."]],[8032,["It is very difficult to see how people","go in for things"]],[8040,["which are very cheap and extremely","troublesome."]],[8049,["I must tell you one thing, I can’t wear","nylon,"]],[8052,["I can’t wear anything artificial, really,","I can’t."]],[8056,["For a while, if I even wear socks also,","My whole body starts paining."]],[8062,["So, it is against you."]],[8065,["Handmade things are few, I agree, but use","as far as possible handmade things."]],[8074,["From the Mother Earth they make very nice,","say, terracotta."]],[8080,["So, I’m a socialist by temperament,","I think."]],[8084,["So, I felt a great urge that I should","really export nothing but terracotta."]],[8095,["And terracotta is such a beautiful thing."]],[8099,["It’s so soothing, it’s so good – it smells","so well."]],[8104,["But people think, “No, we should buy","something that is made"]],[8108,["from America in some machinery thing.”","They go on buying like that."]],[8117,["In America also I was surprised that","beautiful things are selling"]],[8123,["in shops which they call them as outlets,","very good,"]],[8128,["mostly of silk, or of cotton, and leather –","pure leather."]],[8138,["But people will go to big, big markets","and buy all nonsense"]],[8141,["at a very high price and not from there –","means they have no wisdom."]],[8147,["And this is what happens, that the wisdom,","if it is lacking in your sense,"]],[8153,["then this wisdom corrodes the society."]],[8159,["Because wisdom itself shows"]],[8164,["how dangerous it is to go on buying all","these nonsensical things."]],[8171,["Also now you are seeing that people","are taking now more"]],[8176,["to Ayurveda and to homeopathy."]],[8180,["They don’t want to use these horrible","medicines produced by your great country."]],[8186,["You know what they do, Swiss? They send","very big offers"]],[8195,["to doctors from India to come to work","for them."]],[8199,["And supposing they have produced one “A”","sample as you’ve shown,"]],[8204,["then the same one they change a little bit","(and) say “It’s better”."]],[8208,["And you know these medicines, most of them","are very dangerous and troublesome."]],[8214,["By mistake, My family gave Me these","antibiotics."]],[8218,["Since then My legs are very weak and","troublesome – I’ve improved, no doubt."]],[8224,["So, you see, why we are now taking","to this -"]],[8228,["because pollution is there another thing,","which is created by this machinery."]],[8234,["Gandhiji was saying: “There is no need","to use so much machinery.”"]],[8238,["Now, motor cars – we can walk, we can","use trains,"]],[8245,["but people want to go anywhere by motor","car, even if it is about, say,"]],[8251,["ten meters, they don’t want to walk.","That’s how our health has gone down."]],[8257,["I must tell you when I was studying in the","school, My school was about five miles."]],[8263,["And we had a car, and we had also horses,","and what we call is a buggy in our house."]],[8271,["But it was compulsory for us to walk","five miles in the morning."]],[8276,["Evening time the car used to come,"]],[8279,["but morning time we all had to walk","five miles to go to our school."]],[8285,["And in between there was a small, little","mountain which we had to climb."]],[8291,["That is how we learnt about nature. If you","don’t walk, from the car what do you know?"]],[8299,["At the most you can see some lamppost."]],[8303,["What do you see from the car? Nothing,","you cannot see the nature."]],[8309,["And this walking system is very much out","of date now for people. People don’t walk."]],[8317,["I’m not saying that today we are very","changed, and we are very advanced people."]],[8324,["In a way we have gone down because","we cannot walk."]],[8329,["God has given these legs to walk, but","we cannot walk."]],[8333,["We avoid walking. Now, because of that","so many cars."]],[8341,["I know that in some families they have","five cars because 5 family members."]],[8346,["Especially in Spain, I was surprised,","so many cars, so many cars"]],[8351,["and every car has only one person in it","sitting."]],[8357,["Now, problem has started with the pollution","and all these things,"]],[8361,["because we have lost the habits","of depending upon ourselves."]],[8369,["Now see what has happened in, say,"]],[8377,["this Kuala Lumpur and all these places","suffering from what you call, the smoke."]],[8384,["Now I have not done it, if you think that","way. And they are praying to Allah,"]],[8389,["“Give us water”. Why should God give","them water"]],[8392,["when they are doing all kinds of","nonsensical things?"]],[8398,["Now, there is smoke going on, why? Because","they have cut the trees."]],[8403,["So, why do they want to cut the trees?","Because they want to make money, that’s all."]],[8411,["Their wood is coming to India, because in","India also they have cut the trees."]],[8417,["If you go on like this – mad, you will have","pollution, means what?"]],[8422,["Is that, destructive forces will act","and stop it."]],[8429,["For that you don’t have to pray to","the Goddess, it will work out."]],[8433,["And it’s all working out everywhere."]],[8436,["So, whatever you have to have, try to have","something which is handmade."]],[8442,["Even your clothes - need not be many,","try to have it which are handmade -"]],[8450,["is one of the things Sahaja Yogis can do."]],[8454,["There need not be to send money to this","Swiss Bank also."]],[8460,["This Swiss Bank will be very badly exposed","now,"]],[8462,["I’m angry with them for one more thing,","that they had promised that they’ll give"]],[8466,["the money to the Jews and now they are","going like this, they don’t want to give."]],[8471,["When they will die are they going","to take it with them?"]],[8479,["All these sins will be punished and that is","why I’m very happy"]],[8484,["this he has brought in, because I’ve been","talking about it –"]],[8487,["even in that conference I went to in China,","I talked openly about this Swiss Bank."]],[8493,["I have talked to many magistrates and","to many, what you call them,"]],[8500,["the head of the law ministry and all that,","and I’ve told them,"]],[8505,["“Why not we have a conference and say","that this banking is nonsense”."]],[8512,["Now, all types of bad people are taking","advantage of this system"]],[8522,["and are trying to make money, look very","nice or so, I don’t know."]],[8528,["So many have lost their money there,"]],[8530,["I don’t know what was the need to put","all this money there."]],[8533,["That when they die, their children do not","get anything."]],[8537,["But the problem is this greed, is some sort","of a inner defect in a human being."]],[8547,["He becomes greedy, greedy because he has","deviated from dharma."]],[8560,["He thinks he can get pleasure out","of things, he cannot."]],[8566,["And he goes on accumulating and buying","and this and that."]],[8571,["I would say your Mother also does that.","I buy, but I buy things which are handmade."]],[8579,["So that tomorrow, if I have to give it","presents, or if I have to sell off things,"]],[8585,["even the ornaments you have given Me,","I didn’t know what to do, I’m selling them."]],[8590,["What will I do with the ornaments – I have","to buy so many ashrams, this, that."]],[8600,["My family ornaments also I’m selling,"]],[8603,["because I spent money on My family things","also."]],[8607,["Just think of it, what is all this for,","what pleasure does it give us?"]],[8615,["I can understand, if you want to give","somebody a present,"]],[8619,["or somebody you want to give some","happiness, joy – you should do it,"]],[8626,["but just for yourself go on, go on, how","much can you digest it? You cannot."]],[8633,["Joy is much more in giving to others."]],[8637,["It’s not, it’s not a thing that gives you","any understanding of the fundamentals,"]],[8645,["and the fundamentals is that you are","dharma."]],[8651,["Within you is that, that is your valency,","and this materialism absolutely against it,"]],[8659,["because it creates all kinds of people:","mafias, this Swiss bank, cheats -"]],[8672,["we have communities after communities","who are known to be cheats,"]],[8677,["who are very materialistic, they have","no spiritual sense."]],[8681,["So for Sahaja Yogis, I would say -","of course you have said all the mantras"]],[8686,["so I’m supposed to do all that.","But what you have to do"]],[8690,["is not to buy any more anything which is","not handmade. Try it."]],[8696,["At least, there should be some embroidery,"]],[8698,["at least, there should be some work","done on it."]],[8703,["I’m surprised that these things are","not very good for us,"]],[8707,["they are injurious to our health."]],[8710,["So Sahaja Yogis must learn that they","have to walk."]],[8716,["They must walk and they must see","the nature, what is in the nature."]],[8721,["Many of you don’t know what - say, I ask","the name of this flower,"]],[8726,["how many of you know?"]],[8734,["It’s a very sweet name, “Kiss Me Quick”,","apart from its botanical name."]],[8743,["But it is, you see, what I’m saying,","everything you should know -"]],[8747,["you should know about small, small things,","from where do this embroidery comes?"]],[8754,["From where does this sari comes?"]],[8757,["Our Indian men are the worst, I would say,","they don’t know anything whatsoever."]],[8763,["But even western men also have the same","problem."]],[8768,["You must take interest in things in which","you have not taken interest."]],[8772,["For example, Indians don’t know how","to cook, they don’t know!"]],[8776,["Once My husband told Me that he knows","how to cook."]],[8780,["I said, “What? He said, “I’ll make","chapatis, rotis.”"]],[8784,["And what he made was nothing –","Australia, America, this, that."]],[8792,["But he said, “I give up because I was doing","shipping, but shipping means shipping.”"]],[8800,["But minute things you can see, what we","call is a subtle vision, subtle eyesight."]],[8808,["If you walk, look at the nature, love","the trees, love the animals."]],[8814,["You’ll be amazed, there are so many","things to be known"]],[8818,["than reading newspaper, what is there","to read in the newspaper?"]],[8822,["For hours together you go on reading","newspaper, next day you forget it."]],[8827,["You’ll be amazed that they say that","for Goddess it is said that"]],[8834,["“Kataksha Kataksha Nirikshana” – every","glance, She knows everything."]],[8841,["Any glance She puts on any man, woman","or anything, She knows where it is."]],[8848,["And if you are My children you should","also try that,"]],[8852,["because I always used to run out","into jungles, in the forest,"]],[8856,["I used to go to all such places and really","enjoy the beautiful Mother,"]],[8862,["this Mother Earth who has created such","a beautiful thing."]],[8868,["Have you noticed just now that the colors","of the background"]],[8873,["which were made by the Russians and","the colors of this facing thing"]],[8880,["are just the same, they have used the same","colors. It’s true collectivity."]],[8887,["Now, you notice in the nature it’s so","matching, you know."]],[8892,["Nothing gross, nothing loud – it’s","so beautiful,"]],[8895,["this is red but it has green to match it."]],[8899,["This Mother Earth knows everything,","She understands everything,"]],[8903,["She does everything, but what do we do","for Mother Earth? –"]],[8908,["Is to run after artificial things,","machinery, this thing –"]],[8913,["and now a new thing has come, is computer."]],[8918,["It’s all right if you want to write letters","to someone,"]],[8920,["but otherwise it’s quite maddening,","you know."]],[8924,["And this computer will make our brain","absolutely zero."]],[8928,["We’ll be paralyzed, we won’t be able","to think 2 + 2."]],[8932,["So, anything that you want to use also,","should have its maryadas,"]],[8937,["don’t go beyond it. If you take","to swimming,"]],[8941,["you’ll go on swimming till you get sick."]],[8945,["If you are horse-riding, you’ll go on","horse-riding till you fall down."]],[8950,["You see, this is also a kind of a life","which has no maryadas –"]],[8957,["like greed has no maryadas, that’s how","also this kind of nonsense,"]],[8964,["“I am only fond of this, I am only","fond of this.”"]],[8968,["You are a human being, you should never","say like that."]],[8971,["On the contrary you should say, “I must","learn this, I must know this,"]],[8976,["what is this all about?”. It is very","important,"]],[8980,["otherwise your personality will be a dwarf","personality –"]],[8985,["and ultimately people end up in money.","I don’t understand."]],[8991,["I can’t even count 200 notes, can’t even."]],[8995,["I don’t know about money, I should say.","But I’m good at mathematics -"]],[8999,["but I don’t know, whatever money you are","giving goes direct to them"]],[9003,["and they do it what they like. Now,","if somebody says,"]],[9006,["“How much You got for this?”","“I don’t know”."]],[9009,["“How much for royalties?” “I don’t know”,","because I’m not interested."]],[9015,["I’m not interested. What is there to be","so much interested in money?"]],[9020,["But I get money, all right, no problem,","never a problem."]],[9026,["I sold one of My ornaments"]],[9029,["and I got at least 100 times more","than what I have spent."]],[9034,["Maybe you might say it’s vibrations,","whatever you may say."]],[9039,["So to get after money means you get","very much in the clutches of money."]],[9050,["So what is the solution, to get rid","of this greed?"]],[9056,["Is to try and give it to others and see","the joy."]],[9062,["Give something to others, share and see","the joy you feel by giving something."]],[9073,["I must tell you, Gregoire is not her","but I am missing him"]],[9076,["because once I went to a sari shop","and wanted to buy one sari"]],[9082,["but I thought “It’s rather expensive,"]],[9085,["why should I buy such an expensive sari”,","came away."]],[9090,["And you’ll be amazed, he gave Me the same","sari on My birthday"]],[9097,["and I was so filled with joy, because","he bought it next day,"]],[9101,["went and bought it from that shop, kept it","with him and on My birthday he gave Me."]],[9110,["These small, small things can give you","great joy"]],[9114,["in giving people, other people,","not yourself."]],[9120,["I don’t know if I have bought anything","much for Myself in My lifetime, never."]],[9125,["Even if I go out shopping, even if","I am thirsty,"]],[9127,["I won’t even buy one Coca-Cola for Myself."]],[9131,["People know that I don’t buy anything","for Myself,"]],[9136,["practically nothing, but you all give Me","so much, what to do."]],[9139,["Now, I have decided that after these","75 years of age,"]],[9147,["I shouldn’t take anything from you","whatsoever."]],[9151,["But to please you maybe, they are asking","that,"]],[9153,["“Only take a national, international”,","all right. But no more,"]],[9158,["every country shouldn’t bring. What","after all this national, international –"]],[9163,["you are all international people, what is","the need to bring any present for Me?"]],[9169,["I don’t even have time to see them."]],[9174,["I’m so very busy with other things, because","there are so many problems in this world."]],[9181,["So, I would suggest that, to get over","all these things"]],[9185,["we should see ourselves, what we are","doing about it."]],[9189,["I’m sure none of you have money","in the Swiss Bank, thank God."]],[9193,["But never earn more than what you can –","you have, there’s no need."]],[9200,["Whatever comes your way is all right.","Of course if you are doing some work"]],[9205,["of creativity, of creating some designs,","creating something is all right."]],[9213,["But don’t buy things, go on buying things","for yourself"]],[9217,["or putting then money here, hiding, hiding","there, there’s no need."]],[9225,["You see, you’ll feel so satisfied and","so happy being honest,"]],[9231,["being absolutely beyond any problem."]],[9239,["Now this mafia business is there, I agree","with you. Now this mafia can be controlled"]],[9244,["only by the government because they give","such a big tax."]],[9250,["Now I mean, for example, an artisan","in this poor country -"]],[9254,["I will say poor because most of the people","are suffering from tax –"]],[9259,["you see, he has to pay 265 types of taxes."]],[9267,["Italians are known for their art, they make","beautiful things,"]],[9272,["but they cannot because they have to pay","so much taxation."]],[9276,["Only the designers they make the money."]],[9279,["Designers make the money befooling","everybody."]],[9286,["They befool people so much. Once My husband","went to Cairo and bought one scarf for Me."]],[9295,["So, he said, “This is designer’s.”"]],[9298,["I said, “This looks Indian to me, this is","an Indian thing.”"]],[9303,["And surprisingly in the corner it was","written “Made in India”."]],[9309,["He paid £25 for that, in India you can","get it for £2."]],[9318,["So, this is another thing is to run a race","of eliteness."]],[9322,["You see this one was bought by","My son-in-law."]],[9326,["I said: “What is so special?”","He said, “It’s very great, you know.”"]],[9331,["I didn’t know what was so special about","those spectacles."]],[9335,["So, I went to one shop in America"]],[9342,["and they all started saying, “Madam,","Madam, Madam …”."]],[9345,["I said, “What is so Madam about Me?.","Why are they calling Me ‘Madam’?”"]],[9350,["“Oh, You don’t know?” - they said - “This","is Cartier.” I said, “Who is this Cartier?”"]],[9357,["So I’m going to put Kartikeya against him!"]],[9363,["All such stupid ideas, you see, and then","they bought Me a…"]],[9371,["[Aside: “What you call that? The watch was…","what was that watch? Ah, Patek Philippe!] -"]],[9380,["Patek Philippe, that watch they brought","for Me"]],[9385,["and it would not run in time. I said,","“What is this?"]],[9390,["Never keeps the time, it’s always","out of time."]],[9395,["My vibrations must be trying some tricks”."]],[9399,["So I gave it to one of them, I said, “Baba,","show this to the Patek Phillips.”"]],[9403,["Ah, that day Mathias was here. “This","will hit their ego, Mother, very much”."]],[9407,["I said, “Why?” “Because they think","they are the best.”"]],[9411,["I said, “Whatever it is, tell them you","change it, it doesn’t keep to time.”"]],[9416,["Then I asked My daughter to have it,","I said, “Baba, I can’t make …"]],[9420,["I don’t know why, maybe I will have","something simple, it’s better.”"]],[9424,["That too again turned out to be a,","what you call? ‘Designers’."]],[9430,["They are now all - most of these designers","are in jail."]],[9435,["And some of them met Me when I was","coming from Russia."]],[9441,["They are absolutely useless people,","you know."]],[9445,["They take out some idea and sell it","for a high price"]],[9448,["and if you are a fool you go and buy that.","Did you notice that this is Cartier?"]],[9459,["For Sahaja Yogis are simple people. Now","this is the thing is that there are,"]],[9465,["these are also mafias, I tell you, these","are also mafias."]],[9469,["And these mafias are exploiting you,","I’ve written it in My book also,"]],[9473,["if you read it, how these entrepreneurs","are trying to befool you."]],[9478,["You wear simple dress, simple from","handmade – will be much better"]],[9485,["than to wear something that makes you","look like something out of the blue."]],[9492,["And there is no need because it is just","satisfying your ego."]],[9497,["Some people have a habit – as soon as –","say, I have, supposing some dinner set,"]],[9507,["may not be good or… - they’ll come and see","the back of the dinner plate."]],[9512,["“Ah, from where did You get it?” –","“I don’t know.” “You don’t know?”"]],[9517,["“No, no, this was, I think, I think somebody","gave Me, I don’t know, I don’t know.”"]],[9521,["“No, no, You better find out, because","very nice.”"]],[9524,["Next day they’ll go round the whole place","to find out"]],[9527,["if they can get the same dinner set."]],[9531,["And Sahaja Yoga is just the opposite.","I tell you, you depend on Sahaja Yoga."]],[9536,["Once My husband liked one tea set. So","you know London has huge, big stores."]],[9545,["Some of them are really horrid.","I went there –"]],[9549,["baarpre baap - we walked and walked","and walked through so many."]],[9554,["They said, “All right, we promise after","6 months.” Another said, “7 months”,"]],[9558,["another said, “8 months, you give us","the order.” So I gave up the idea."]],[9565,["Then C.P. said, “What has happened","to their factories?”"]],[9568,["I said, “They don’t have anything, they","are exporting.”"]],[9571,["Then I went to Australia, you’ll be amazed","- and there for a special price,"]],[9578,["just for propagating, they had put","these tea sets there."]],[9585,["Imagine, in Australia, and I got it","for the half price."]],[9591,["So, if you don’t have greed you get","what you want just there."]],[9600,["Just there you get it."]],[9604,["But if you have greed, then God makes","you dance. All right?"]],[9610,["That is what is so simple as that -","whatever you want you can get it,"]],[9614,["if you don’t have greed about it."]],[9618,["That’s such an enslaving thing within us,","that we have greed."]],[9624,["I mean I can give you 1,001 examples","of that, 1,001."]],[9631,["That if you don’t ask for anything, if you","don’t desire for anything,"]],[9637,["you get what you need, whatever you need","you get."]],[9644,["But if you go on desiring, then go mad","after it. Go there, get this and get lost."]],[9651,["And then the thing also gets lost."]],[9655,["That’s why it is said, better try","to develop a detachment."]],[9663,["It’s all right, if it is there well and","good, if it is not there, doesn’t matter."]],[9669,["Then you’ll be surprised your attention","will be so subtle."]],[9673,["Now none of you I think have seen these","beautiful flowers, what are there."]],[9679,["The beautiful embroidery that is there.","The way they have done this."]],[9685,["Now can you tell Me how many there are,","hands in this work –"]],[9692,["14, 28. This side 14, this side 14."]],[9708,["I mean, inclusive of all these other","things."]],[9715,["So you don’t notice anything and your","attention becomes…"]],[9721,["“Mahamaya” - they say has been - “it has","been the Mahamaya”. This is no explanation."]],[9726,["Your attention if it is clear, is simple,","you can see the thing clearly."]],[9734,["And with that attention only, that","attention yourself"]],[9740,["takes you to the right place where you","have to go,"]],[9743,["you get the right thing what you want","to buy."]],[9750,["Can you tell Me you see these carpets","are from where?"]],[9761,["They are mostly from Russia."]],[9766,["I went to Russia and I saw this carpet","factory. They have no sense of export also."]],[9775,["So I told them that, “How much will","a carpet cost?” - Doctor knows -"]],[9780,["They said, “Only $20.” I said, “Baba,","$20 for a carpet?”"]],[9786,["So, I told Doctor, “Now what to do,","we have to buy many”."]],[9790,["I said, “How much for export?” “$200.”"]],[9796,["I said, “In India the other way round.","If you have to export something,"]],[9800,["then the price is less.” I said,","“All right,"]],[9806,["so I guess we must think of the solution","because I need it.”"]],[9810,["So I asked about 20 Sahaja Yogis to go","and buy each one."]],[9814,["To Russians they give for $20.","I said, “All right, you bring these.”"]],[9821,["So, you should go in for solutions and not","for problems."]],[9827,["Greed is a problem, greed is a problem."]],[9832,["How to get rid of the greed is the point."]],[9835,["And to get rid of the greed is that","if I buy something –"]],[9839,["for whom should I buy this one, for whom","should I buy?"]],[9845,["Ah, this will be all right for another","friend of mine, like that."]],[9850,["If you train your mind on these lines,","not for yourself, but for others,"]],[9857,["then you’ll be amazed this greed will run","away and you’ll have joy."]],[9864,["As you want to give Me things, I understand","that, I also want to give you."]],[9869,["In the same way, think of all others,","they are all brothers and sisters."]],[9876,["From other countries, make friends","with other countries."]],[9880,["If giving is there, then this greed goes","away (indistinct)"]],[9884,["and you get what you want. It’s a very","simple mantra."]],[9892,["It’s surprising, so far, with all","the miracles,"]],[9902,["we don’t understand that whatever","we need also be provided for."]],[9907,["But you must need it, not for stupid","collection of things."]],[9915,["This was a very, very good thing, acted","very well, I enjoyed it thoroughly,"]],[9921,["this Swiss Bank laundering. I know","My country suffers from it."]],[9928,["Now, the another drama, which was done","by the English,"]],[9933,["shows – it’s a – “Pilgrim’s Progress” is","an old, quite an old drama,"]],[9939,["which I have read long time back. But this","is the real pilgrims they have shown,"]],[9944,["how a seeker goes into wrong ways, methods,"]],[9949,["and throughout they have very nicely","brought in how even a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[9954,["while rising, falls into different pits.","So it’s a very good thing for you to know"]],[9960,["that if you are Sahaja Yogis, you should be","very careful, and you should see that"]],[9966,["you don’t fall into these pits and","ultimately the ego and superego."]],[9973,["In the west the problem is more of ego,","not of superego. And for ego,"]],[9986,["to accept that you have ego is the only","way; and then it will drop out."]],[9994,["If you know there is ego, ego will","drop out."]],[9999,["The simple thing is to know that you have","ego. Ego of something."]],[10004,["People have ego of any nonsense, you know."]],[10008,["There was one lady very proud","and egoistical."]],[10011,["So I asked about her, “What is the matter","with her?”"]],[10017,["“Because she knows how to make dolls” –","Why?"]],[10021,["That should give you ego or what?","I didn’t understand that part."]],[10025,["But this is what it is, even for small","things people have ego,"]],[10028,["and all this designing and all that","is based on your stupid ego"]],[10037,["which makes you buy all these things","to show off your ego."]],[10041,["So try to be humble – humble and try","to understand"]],[10049,["that all these worldly things we are not","going to take them with us."]],[10054,["They are going to lie down here. I am not","saying you renounce."]],[10057,["I’m not saying you take sanyasa, but you","should know that"]],[10061,["the value of these things is nothing","compared to you."]],[10065,["When ego comes, this idiocity comes in."]],[10068,["You think by wearing something great","you are very much influencing others."]],[10075,["You may, but those who are influenced","are another set of fools, I must say."]],[10082,["Once I was wearing a ring and I went","to shopping in one of the places"]],[10089,["and they were so respectful to Me.","I said, “Suddenly the shopkeepers,"]],[10093,["they never respect Me because I’m","an Indian – what has happened?”"]],[10098,["So I had gone to a shop where the lady","was known to Me."]],[10102,["She said, “May I ask You, is this real?”","I said, “What do you mean, real?”"]],[10108,["“Is it a real emerald?” “Yes, yes, very old","from My family.”"]],[10114,["“Ah, so Your family very rich?”"]],[10118,["“No, no, it was from My forefathers,","I’m just wearing that.”"]],[10124,["“Oh my God, if it is real, what will be","the price?” I said, “How will I know,"]],[10129,["it was bought long time back, I don’t know","the price.” “No, can you get me one?”"]],[10134,["I said, “Why do you want to have it,","you can have this one if you like.”"]],[10138,["Like that, you know, a small thing makes","them so…, that you are so great. It’s not."]],[10146,["What is the greatest thing in us is","our Spirit,"]],[10150,["is the Spirit that we have and we should","know that we should be proud of it,"]],[10155,["that we have got the Spirit within us."]],[10158,["And if you become proud, then you will not","do nonsensical things."]],[10163,["You are people who are all realized souls."]],[10167,["And already, you have crossed over this","pilgrims stage, you are much above that."]],[10172,["Now the greatest thing is to know that","we are spiritual people"]],[10177,["and as spiritual people – you even","dominate Me, in a way."]],[10184,["If you all desire for something, I can’t","get over it."]],[10189,["I have to accept. I have to keep you","pleased."]],[10196,["Many things I’m doing just because","you want it;"]],[10201,["doesn’t matter, it doesn’t matter to Me","because nothing comes over My head."]],[10206,["So it’s all right, whatever children want,","let them do."]],[10209,["But the one point is this ego has to be","really under control."]],[10217,["There’s one little more point I want","to tell you,"]],[10221,["because tomorrow I may not be able to say,"]],[10223,["in Navaratri, you see, I am bound by other","things, is this –"]],[10228,["I wanted to talk to people who are married","in Sahaja Yoga, especially to the ladies."]],[10234,["I think some of them are extremely","dominating and stupid."]],[10242,["What is marriage? Marriage is honeymoon","as they call it."]],[10248,["Honey is the essence and moon is the peace."]],[10253,["Now if the women are quarrelsome,","fighting, sarcastic,"]],[10260,["it is absolutely a hell for man."]],[10265,["Instead of that, if woman knows","the essence, the honey,"]],[10272,["she should know how to please the husband,","to bring peace in the family."]],[10278,["Now some of the husbands are drunkards","or anything – not in Sahaja Yoga."]],[10283,["What pleases the husband?"]],[10288,["You see, in a way, it’s a trick."]],[10291,["It’s a trick of a realized soul, how","to please others."]],[10297,["What do we do to our husbands?","Do we try to please?"]],[10302,["First of all find out what he likes."]],[10308,["My husband, I would say - he’s gone away,","thank God -"]],[10311,["he used to say, “You shouldn’t wear","any flower in your head.”"]],[10314,["But in Maharashtra all the married women","are supposed to wear flowers."]],[10319,["Since that day I have never worn any flower","in My head."]],[10324,["It’s all right, doesn’t matter, he didn’t","know what I was,"]],[10330,["so he said, “Don’t wear any flowers,","I don’t like.” Then he said,"]],[10334,["“You must wear bangles” because he comes","from a very traditional family."]],[10337,["All My life I have worn bangles. It pleases","him, what’s the matter?"]],[10344,["Little, little things you do just to please","him,"]],[10348,["then he also starts thinking, “See, what","should I do for My wife?”."]],[10352,["But first it must start from woman,","not from man,"]],[10357,["because women are responsible","for the society."]],[10361,["In the western culture they had not told","what is their job is."]],[10367,["Man’s job is economics, politics,","money earning."]],[10372,["They have made a mess out of it, I agree","with you. It’s quite a big mess."]],[10378,["But your job is to make the society."]],[10382,["And to make the society, first you must","know how to keep children pleased,"]],[10387,["how to keep your husband pleased, how","to help and be close to them (Unclear)."]],[10392,["On the contrary, if you try all the time","to dominate,"]],[10397,["that’s not your job to dominate at all."]],[10400,["Your job is to make neutralize his","domination by simple, simple things."]],[10410,["I’ll give you an example. Thank God","he is not here!"]],[10417,["He knows, he knows I’m very, I am very","clever in certain things."]],[10424,["In his office he had a gentleman. I never","used to interfere with his office."]],[10430,["But there was one gentleman, good one,"]],[10433,["who gave up his organization and joined","another one"]],[10437,["because it was a private one, he was","getting more money, so he joined that."]],[10441,["But there he found it was horrible, so he","wanted to come back to Shipping Corporation."]],[10449,["But My husband is very particular about","rules and regulations."]],[10452,["He said, “No, no, no, now I won’t have you,","I don’t want to see your face, get out”,"]],[10455,["this thing, that (thing). So he came to Me.","Normally, I never interfere."]],[10462,["He came to Me and he said, “If You tell","him he might listen.”"]],[10466,["I said, “No, if I tell him he will never","listen. But I know how to do it.”"]],[10472,["So I told him that this gentleman came","to see Me."]],[10477,["“Ha, so he’s come to the right person, now","are you going to trouble me about it?”"]],[10481,["I said, “No, no, no, not Me, but just think","why he came to Me.”"]],[10486,["He said, “Why?” “Because he thinks I’m more","generous than you are.”"]],[10490,["Immediately this competition."]],[10500,["And that fellow got the job, he was","a great friend of his,"]],[10503,["even in London he was helping him a lot."]],[10506,["So, when we think that we have to control","our husband,"]],[10512,["it’s better to do it in a very simple way."]],[10519,["Only on fundamentals you can put down","your foot."]],[10523,["Otherwise for small, small things,"]],[10526,["if you go on dominating your husband","I tell you, you will miss the point."]],[10531,["You have married for stupidity or","for honeymoon?"]],[10539,["And in the West, especially in Italy, we","have had very bad experiences of women."]],[10544,["English also, I must say. English girls","also have given Me lot of trouble."]],[10549,["I mean, they are banned now, because","I can’t help it."]],[10555,["One girl from Silom she was married","to somebody in…"]],[10561,["[Aside, maybe to a child: “Sit down,","sit down”] -"]],[10563,["she was married to somebody in USA."]],[10568,["Imagine from that horrible Silom where","there’s everyday at least 30 murders,"]],[10576,["she got such a good chance to go to USA."]],[10579,["Of course, USA’s also not a very great","place - but she started behaving"]],[10586,["as if she is a childish person and talking","to him in such a manner."]],[10593,["He told Me “Mother, she is a sadist.","Whenever I telephone to her she talks to me"]],[10599,["in such a sarcastic manner and this","and that, that I’m surprised.”"]],[10604,["I said, “A lady from Silom? I can’t","believe it!”"]],[10608,["Then he told Me what she talked to him and","how she talked to him. I was amazed."]],[10613,["I mean, no man would be happy to hear","all these things."]],[10617,["But she thought she was very friendly, and","she was joking or something like that."]],[10624,["This doesn’t work out in marriage."]],[10629,["Man doesn’t want a wife to be on the horse","and beating with a whip."]],[10639,["Why has he married?"]],[10642,["For the happiness, for the joy, for","the sweetness of a woman."]],[10652,["It’s a very important thing I wanted","to talk"]],[10655,["because so many of women are thinking","that they are something great."]],[10660,["Some of them have some money, some of them","have some jobs,"]],[10664,["but first job is to keep the society","very happy"]],[10669,["and to keep your husband happy –","is the first job."]],[10673,["If a woman cannot keep the husband happy,","she is no good for us."]],[10679,["She is no good Sahaja Yogini. This is","a place, like a man"]],[10684,["who is working in the office, he has","to keep his boss pleased."]],[10688,["If he doesn’t please his boss, he is","useless, he’s thrown out of."]],[10692,["In the same way a woman has to think about","the husband, in a very kindly manner,"]],[10698,["because this is her job, this is why","she is marrying."]],[10704,["Otherwise she should not marry, she can do","what she likes."]],[10710,["It’s a difficult thing to convince anyone"]],[10715,["because, you see, men are right-sided,","they are hot-tempered."]],[10719,["But I have told you just now how to capture","their anger."]],[10729,["I’ve seen also in the films, you see","all romantic scenes going on –"]],[10733,["it never happens, there’s nobody is","like that,"]],[10736,["you see, it’s all absurd things you see,"]],[10739,["so you expect them to be Clark Gable","or somebody, it’s not so."]],[10746,["You have to love, you have to take","your husband into your heart first."]],[10753,["This is your duty, otherwise what else","are you doing?"]],[10762,["I was shocked, a girl from Silom -","and this boy has said,"]],[10765,["“Mother, you can kill me, but I will not","have that girl here,"]],[10769,["because she is not joy-giving.”","It’s a fact."]],[10773,["So if your wife is like that supposing -","now I am telling men."]],[10780,["The trick of the trade is, if your wife","is like that,"]],[10784,["try to understand why she does it."]],[10788,["What is her problem, why is she","dominating you?"]],[10793,["Or you think she is dominating you. Most","of the times, most of the men who talk,"]],[10798,["“Oh, wives are like this, wives”… they are","very dominating."]],[10803,["Why is she dominating you, what’s wrong","with you, that she is dominating?"]],[10809,["If you introspect, you’ll find that you","give very little time to her."]],[10815,["Now, the other part is, there was one lady,","she wanted to have a divorce."]],[10820,["I said, “Why?” “Because he goes to work","all the time"]],[10824,["and he is not there and this and that.”"]],[10829,["But I said, “If you divorce, then you will","never be with him."]],[10832,["So why do you want to have a divorce?","At least, at least he gives you some time,"]],[10838,["but if you divorce, then he’ll never be","with you, so why do you ask for divorce?”"]],[10842,["I can’t understand the logic."]],[10845,["I mean women should not be brainless,","isn’t it - to say such a thing."]],[10850,["If you want to divorce your husband","for this – it’s absurd."]],[10856,["Now, for men it is important that they","should give some time,"]],[10865,["pay some attention and get some things","that they like."]],[10872,["Now, I’ll give you again My own example."]],[10875,["My husband never brought any flowers","for Me, you all bring flowers for Me,"]],[10880,["but he never brought any flowers for Me,","whether it was birthday or anything."]],[10886,["Then I realized that this man has no sense","of flowers."]],[10891,["He doesn’t know what is a rose or what is","any other flower."]],[10896,["And he might bring something which is","horrible, you know."]],[10900,["Maybe (a) cactus he might bring."]],[10904,["It’s better he doesn’t bring anything,","because that would be insulting, isn’t it?"]],[10911,["And then one day he admitted, “I don’t know","anything about flowers,"]],[10914,["now will you tell me – except for roses,","I don’t know anything.”"]],[10920,["And you’ll be amazed, even roses, he misses","out (for that? Indistinct)."]],[10924,["So, with such an ignorance of things,"]],[10926,["if your husband doesn’t do, it shows","consideration."]],[10933,["But men should try to know what a woman","likes, what she wants."]],[10940,["Moreover, men have their own style","of thinking."]],[10945,["Now, to give My own example again,","better (it) is."]],[10954,["He buys always very expensive things."]],[10957,["So, I’ve told him, “Don’t buy anything","for Me.” So, “You don’t like?”"]],[10961,["“No, no, I like it, but too much of these","too expensive things, why should you buy?”"]],[10966,["So, he is very fond of buying these kind","of sweaters from that Scotch House,"]],[10972,["very expensive they are, £250 each,","you know."]],[10977,["I don’t know how many I have, how many","in black, how many, you see."]],[10982,["I told him, “I’ll get it from Switzerland,","they are much cheaper there” and all that."]],[10988,["Then another is he wants to buy a cashmere","coat for Me, always."]],[10993,["I must be having at least 10 of them","hanging,"]],[10997,["but he likes to give that only – all right."]],[11000,["So, I’m passing out them to My daughters,","granddaughters and all that."]],[11005,["Then what to do now? You see, men –","he doesn’t mean anything bad,"]],[11009,["but because he doesn’t know, doesn’t know."]],[11015,["First thing he did was to, when in India,","before going to the Puja,"]],[11020,["he went to buy a sari for Me. The one","of My nephews went with him."]],[11027,["So he says, “Give me the most expensive","sari that you have.”"]],[11034,["So these people thought there’s somebody","has come now."]],[11037,["The shopkeepers could understand this","gentleman doesn’t know anything of it."]],[11042,["So they brought out a sari, said,","“This is the most expensive,"]],[11046,["the price is 45,000 rupees” – in those","days this was."]],[11050,["“All right, all right, you give me. I have","a card, will you take the card?”"]],[11053,["“Yes, yes, we’ll take the card.” He bought","the sari for Me."]],[11057,["It is so heavy, it is so heavy that it was","something…"]],[11063,["[Hindi aside]"]],[11068,["That… what do you call that, arm.. – you","wear… Some yogis: Armor."]],[11071,["Shri Mataji: Eh? Some yogis: Armor.","Shri Mataji: Very heavy, you know."]],[11076,["I said, “Now what?”","He said, “You must wear for the Puja.\""]],[11080,["I was walking like a giant, you know."]],[11090,["There’s a description of your Mother is","“Ati saumya Ati raudra” –"]],[11095,["She is extremely soft and extremely","terrible."]],[11099,["But, I don’t know with that sari,","how I sat!"]],[11102,["I sat in one place glued down into that."]],[11107,["Now to get up I didn’t know how to get up","with that weight on My body. You see?"]],[11112,["And then I brought it and put it properly","in a box and this and that."]],[11118,["So he said, “When are you wearing that","next?” “Now,” I said, “Please,"]],[11121,["I’ve kept it nicely for one wedding,","I’ll wear sometime.”"]],[11126,["I promised him and kept it there, because","he doesn’t understand about saris."]],[11132,["I know he doesn’t understand about saris."]],[11135,["So if he doesn’t understand, whatever","he buys, I say “All right”."]],[11140,["And he spends so much money on those","things, you know,"]],[11143,["45,000 rupees for such a sari...","[Hindi words]"]],[11149,["So he doesn’t understand what is real,","what is unreal, nothing – doesn’t matter."]],[11156,["You have to just see his heart, how he","is giving you,"]],[11161,["with what love he is giving you. He doesn’t","understand."]],[11165,["So what can you do, poor man, you know."]],[11168,["I always buy suit lengths for him or suits","for him, I always – Myself."]],[11174,["Once he said, “All right, I’m going to buy","this time.” I said, “Better buy.”"]],[11177,["He bought such a horrible one and he went","to the office"]],[11181,["and everybody said, “Sir, this is not","your taste.”"]],[11188,["So he threw it away, he said, “I will never","buy now,"]],[11191,["can you, better go and buy for myself.”"]],[11194,["See, it’s - but the trouble is if women","take interest and know"]],[11199,["what sort of color he will like and this","and that."]],[11202,["And also public opinion is very important","for men, for example what the public says."]],[11208,["Like once I painted My drawing room","with a very nice color,"]],[11213,["pink and black film mixed – very nice.","Because it’s a sign of warmth."]],[11219,["He said, “What is this color you have","put it?"]],[11221,["You should have done this and that”,","he started shouting."]],[11224,["I said, “All right, tomorrow we are having","a party, after that I’ll change it.”"]],[11228,["Next day the people came in, they said,","“Oh, what a color, what a color,"]],[11232,["how have you made this color, how did…?”","He started looking at Me."]],[11237,["I said, “Should I remove it?”","“No, no, no, no, no, it’s very nice.”"]],[11244,["Men care for public opinion very much","and you should see"]],[11249,["that you create a good public opinion","in his presence,"]],[11255,["so that he’ll appreciate you. All these","are tricks, you see?"]],[11259,["I tell you, men are very simple, but you","have to understand them."]],[11265,["Sometimes they get angry, doesn’t matter."]],[11268,["Actually, if they are angry with somebody","else, they will come and put it on you."]],[11273,["It’s better, because if they do anything","to others, they’ll beat them."]],[11277,["You are not going to beat (them)."]],[11281,["If you understand few things about men,","it can work out."]],[11286,["Of course, some are very miserable","husbands, I know,"]],[11290,["and some miserable wives – for them we have","divorce allowed"]],[11294,["in our Sahaja Yoga, we have divorce","for them."]],[11298,["So that is the thing I wanted to tell you,"]],[11301,["that you should make a very good housewife,","a very good Gruha Lakshmi."]],[11306,["Now, why I am telling you this, that I am","suffering from Gruha Lakshmi’s chakra,"]],[11314,["and all the doctors have told Me it is","because in the collective"]],[11318,["Gruha Lakshmis are not all right, because","they are not good housewives."]],[11327,["Like I’ll tell you now we have Swiss women.","They are very good, agreed about that,"]],[11332,["but very fond of cleanliness. Swiss are","mad after cleanliness, women, women."]],[11339,["You can’t talk to them even for five","minutes. If you are sitting there"]],[11343,["they are picking up this, picking up that,","picking up that, picking all the…,"]],[11345,["cleaning, cleaning, cleaning. It’s very","difficult, Swiss women."]],[11351,["Now, I was… - Eritrea,"]],[11353,["Alga told Me that the women of Eritrea","are known to be Swiss women."]],[11359,["So, doesn’t matter if the house is little","untidy, if there’s something fallen off."]],[11366,["In India no woman will do that."]],[11369,["Now, the guests are sitting and she’s","with the Hoover."]],[11379,["Like another thing is, like anything","breaks, say,"]],[11385,["supposing the thermometer breaks –","in India they’ll say, “Very good,"]],[11388,["now there will be no temperature,","thermometer’s broken.”"]],[11393,["But I’ve seen in the West, it’s very","surprising,"]],[11396,["supposing some coffee spills, I’m a guest,","immediately they’ll bring the Hoover,"]],[11402,["bring something to clean it –","in the presence of the person."]],[11406,["Now, if a glass breaks, finished."]],[11409,["It’s not important. This is a very subtle","type of materialism, I think,"]],[11413,["that the person is sitting there, who is","a guest,"]],[11417,["and why are you trying to do all these","things in her presence or in his presence?"]],[11424,["But this Western women never understand."]],[11428,["Another thing is, now, you go to an Indian","house. Their color scheme is different."]],[11435,["If you go to south Indians theirs is","different. Everybody has their own taste."]],[11440,["As soon as they will enter –","Western women –"]],[11444,["“What a color scheme! What a thing you","have bought! Oh my God, this is horrible.”"]],[11448,["Immediately they will criticize","on the face."]],[11453,["So another point is that you must always","consider the feelings of others."]],[11459,["Woman is there to give proper understanding","of feelings of others, what they think."]],[11467,["Or they go to an Indian house which","will be smelling of their food, “Huh”."]],[11475,["They’ll eat the same food, they’ll enjoy","the food,"]],[11478,["but they’ll try to show, to show that it is","something lower."]],[11484,["This is very Western, I must say."]],[11487,["If somebody is wearing a dress, immediately","they’ll pass a remark."]],[11494,["Very Western idea. You will not find","good Indians doing that,"]],[11500,["I don’t know about the modern Indians","what sort of things they are."]],[11504,["But immediately they’ll say things which","will hurt."]],[11508,["This is not the way a woman should look."]],[11512,["On the contrary, always praise -","what’s the harm?"]],[11517,["By praising something you are not losing","your business."]],[11523,["By saying, “What a nice thing, what a nice","sari, what nice clothes” – what’s the harm?"]],[11531,["You’ll enjoy your sweetness, you know?","Really enjoy your sweetness."]],[11536,["It’s not telling lies, not to be that","honest also necessary."]],[11540,["Because you don’t like something you must","say, “I don’t like it.”"]],[11543,["This word has to go from Sahaja Yoga.","“I like this and I don’t like that.\""]],[11554,["If I, say, saying that, how many will","remain in Sahaja Yoga?"]],[11566,["So it’s very important to drop this","“I like it, I don’t like it.”"]],[11571,["Who are you to like or not like?"]],[11574,["What about your Spirit? What about","your heart?"]],[11579,["So again the same thing comes to,","that women have to have a heart,"]],[11585,["very large heart, beautiful heart.","And your Guru is a Mother,"]],[11593,["so you have to be wonderful mothers","and wonderful wives"]],[11598,["and should have very, very large hearts."]],[11606,["So that all this selfishness, even this","bank will collapse if you do that."]],[11615,["It is existing because we have small","hearts."]],[11619,["If you have large hearts this will","collapse – isn’t it?"]],[11627,["I have said it, especially because I’ve had","many complaints about the women"]],[11632,["who are married here, some Indian women","also. That’s why I’m telling you."]],[11639,["Best reports are about Russian women","I must say,"]],[11645,["very, very good reports about them."]],[11648,["They are very satisfied souls, they want","very little, they are not greedy."]],[11653,["It’s surprising, communism has done","so much good to them."]],[11656,["It’s not communism, but the extremities","of communism has thrown them"]],[11662,["into that area where they don’t have any","sense of possession, they don’t have."]],[11670,["Their government said, “All right, you can","have your flats and look after them.”"]],[11673,["Said, “We don’t want to have, you have it.”"]],[11677,["Government servants were told that","“you can have your cars”."]],[11680,["Said, “No, no, we don’t want, you’d","better have.”"]],[11684,["Because just to own the car is such","a headache – they know."]],[11689,["Let the government have the headache.","They are not, you know,"]],[11693,["sort of people who are even conscious","of possessiveness."]],[11698,["Of course, now, they had some funny people."]],[11701,["I’m forgetting his name, who was finance","minister you had,"]],[11706,["and he was in Geneva, where he learned","all the tricks of the trade"]],[11712,["and he brought forth lots of reforms,","so-called."]],[11716,["So now Leningrad and Moscow have become","very expensive places –"]],[11721,["thanks to Swiss influence."]],[11724,["So this has happened there also, but still","the people are very good,"]],[11729,["and the ladies who come from there, even","Romanian girls are very much respected,"]],[11735,["now everybody wants Romanian or Russians,"]],[11745,["or from Kiev. But this time they didn’t","come,"]],[11749,["we are sorry they are not here, I’m missing","them all."]],[11754,["Lastly, I have to tell you that there’s","a very good book, Arun Apte has written."]],[11763,["This is the book. You all should buy it."]],[11766,["I don’t know, what is the price you have","put it?"]],[11770,["[Shri Mataji speaks aside in Hindi about","the book and its price]"]],[11795,["Alright. So, those who want to have","this book should apply."]],[11799,["There are only five, are here,","very good book."]],[11803,["So, you will understand about Indian music."]],[11808,["It is said that this music has come","from Omkara."]],[11814,["And it is very sort of – sensible music."]],[11821,["Now, I think all those musicians who sang","before Me,"]],[11828,["who were singing western song, was alright."]],[11833,["But what is missing in that: melody.","It’s not melodious."]],[11838,["You see, is like little bit you sing,","then you sing this,"]],[11841,["then you shout, then you bring it down,","then do like this."]],[11845,["And they think that they have to sing","through their heart."]],[11850,["They have to express the feeling","of their heart."]],[11853,["Now, supposing somebody is dejected,","so he sings the song of dejection."]],[11858,["Then another one who is talking about love,","he starts to sing a song."]],[11862,["He may not be, but artificially they want","to produce that effect."]],[11868,["There is no need; to sing in parts,","like one word, then one word,"]],[11876,["there’s no melody in it, there’s no flow","in it."]],[11880,["And, while, Russian songs, though they","were folk songs, were very melodious."]],[11886,["But don’t worry, Americans are invading","that part also."]],[11891,["They are having all this horrible music","there."]],[11893,["Now, the music means, it should please you.","It should give you more entertainment;"]],[11899,["not to make you unhappy, not to make","you sad."]],[11903,["If you have all these feelings within you,","then you should try to say like this:"]],[11911,["“Yes, there is problem, but I’ll get","over it.”"]],[11915,["Because you are Sahaja Yogis, you have","to show the victory;"]],[11919,["the victorious nature of yours,","in your music."]],[11922,["I’m not talking about others; they go on","crying, weeping and singing."]],[11927,["But there is no melody first of all, it is","just part, part, part, part."]],[11932,["Even the orchestra, which I was surprised:","it all goes like this"]],[11936,["“ke, ke, ke, ke, ke”, then it goes","“ke, ke, ke, ke, ke”."]],[11941,["But Indian orchestra, you will see,","is melodious. It flows like a river."]],[11950,["So, this difference is very bad. So, I would","request all the musicians who are singing,"]],[11957,["the singing doesn’t mean that you use words","which nobody can understand."]],[11968,["Words must be clear-cut and the melody","must be there."]],[11973,["Now, in Indian ragas, there is melody","but words are not important."]],[11979,["So, you enjoy the tune and everything,"]],[11981,["whether you know the language or not,","doesn’t matter."]],[11985,["So, when you can combine melody","with western music,"]],[11990,["you will see how different it will be."]],[11995,["And this book will teach you. This is","a very good book,"]],[11999,["which you should have, and which you should","understand"]],[12002,["that how the music can cure you,","music can give you joy,"]],[12011,["what is the basic, the essence of music.","And then you can flower it out."]],[12018,["I am sure, if Indian musicians take","to western music,"]],[12023,["will be much better than to western music","as it is."]],[12031,["I can’t understand, these people are","so famous"]],[12035,["and people think they are very well-earning","and all that."]],[12039,["In America, anybody can earn like that,","but to make it a proper music,"]],[12044,["I think you must have the basis","of Indian music."]],[12047,["Then you can expand it as you like."]],[12051,["Now, please try to buy this book,","to understand Indian music."]],[12057,["There’s no price yet given, but it won’t be","much more than normal,"]],[12062,["so next time, I think for Diwali Puja, they","might bring more. Eh? Ganapatipule."]],[12068,["[Shri Mataji speaks aside in Hindi to know","when the book will be available]"]],[12076,["Accha."]],[12078,["I will try to get more of these, but this","you must really read,"]],[12083,["because you will know what is the essence","of music, alright?"]],[12090,["And, lastly, today is the 4th day","of Navaratri"]],[12100,["and they have given Me - some of them","are names which are really horrid,"]],[12112,["but they must be people who have suffered","so much"]],[12117,["and they asked Mother to kill those","horrible rakshasas."]],[12124,["Now in a way, it all will kill in its","natural course, I know that."]],[12133,["If you people take to sense, because you","are the ones who can do it."]],[12140,["If you do not try to acquire things which","you don’t want, unnecessary things."]],[12148,["If you try to reduce all these things","and take to something natural"]],[12157,["and love the Mother Earth, I am sure","it will work out."]],[12162,["The Mother Earth herself will work it out."]],[12166,["You know this earthquake. Now nobody","is going in the church."]],[12173,["But I didn’t do anything. It’s the Mother","Earth."]],[12179,["Now nobody goes in the church. What -","I didn’t do anything, I would not."]],[12186,["I was sorry for the art-pieces gone, but","see now how the nature is working out."]],[12193,["Now Islamic people, these Islamic people","from Indonesia onward,"]],[12200,["all these people are suffering from","the smoke – I didn’t do that."]],[12206,["Because when you try to do something wrong"]],[12209,["it comes back to you. Action has","a reaction."]],[12216,["So, your faces should be Sahaj. You should","be Sahaj."]],[12221,["You shouldn’t look like strained people.","I can’t understand."]],[12227,["You are Sahaj and be in that Sahaj mood.","I’m sorry I’ve taken so much time,"]],[12233,["but tomorrow I won’t be able to speak","all these things to you."]],[12237,["And you should try to think about it,","that “Our Mother loves me,"]],[12242,["She wants us to have a good family, She","wants us to look after our children.”"]],[12246,["So, I have advised all the men, as well","as the women."]],[12251,["It’s better to be hen-pecked, there’s","no harm."]],[12255,["But hen-pecked doesn’t mean they are","hen-pecked."]],[12259,["See, they are – just to please your wife,","what’s the harm?"]],[12266,["But that doesn’t mean if she dominates you.","That’s not the thing."]],[12272,["Like, “Come to my father’s house, I must","go to my mother’s house”."]],[12277,["All these kind of things you should not","permit."]],[12281,["But women should also understand,","her family is more important"]],[12286,["than father, mother, even Mataji."]],[12292,["Because I’ll be only happy to see a happy","family."]],[12298,["So, thank you very much."]]]);
